# Curaleaf First Page daily edition (brief #5807, 09:00 CT hard deadline): publish
# attempts every 10 min from 06:00 to 08:50 CT plus the 08:45 CT hard publish.
# 11:00-14:59 UTC covers 06:00-08:59 CT in both CDT and CST; curaleaf-publish.sh drops
# runs outside 06:00-08:50 CT, and the renderer stops once today's edition is served.
*/10 11-14 * * * /app/curaleaf-publish.sh cron >/proc/1/fd/1 2>&1
45 13,14 * * * /app/curaleaf-publish.sh cron >/proc/1/fd/1 2>&1
